            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>{{#match @site.locale "en"}}“…I never imagined I would be sharing and learning about so many different subjects…”{{else}}“…Nunca me imaginé que iba a compartir y aprender sobre muchísimas temáticas…”{{/match}}</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/marcosgal/96/2453_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>marcosgal</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>{{#match @site.locale "en"}}“…Once I got into the Criptonautas world, I realized that what I want is freedom.”{{else}}“…Una vez que me metí en el mundo criptonauta, me di cuenta de que lo que quiero es libertad.”{{/match}}</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/el.luigi/96/6795_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>el.luigi</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>{{#match @site.locale "en"}}“…Every peso paid is absolutely worth it. You can see the dedication in the book, the forum, Discord and everything in general.”{{else}}“…Cada peso pagado lo vale absolutamente. Se ve la dedicación en el libro, foro, Discord y todo en general.”{{/match}}</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/charly_hg1/96/2404_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>CHARLY_HG1</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>{{#match @site.locale "en"}}“A couple of months ago I paid for access to your book and course, and found far more than I expected.”{{else}}“Hace un par de meses pagué el acceso a tu libro y curso, encontrando muchísimo más de lo esperado.”{{/match}}</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://avatars.criptonautas.co/patch/96/ejdianti" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>ejdianti</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>{{#match @site.locale "en"}}“How great to have this forum and community so you don't go crazy with all the information out there…”{{else}}“Qué genial es tener este foro y comunidad para no volverse loco con tanta información que hay por ahí…”{{/match}}</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/faze/96/1116_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>Faze</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>{{#match @site.locale "en"}}“…I'm grateful for the blog and the forum, for their respectful style of learning and contributing.”{{else}}“…Se agradece el blog y el foro por su estilo respetuoso, de aprendizaje y aportación.”{{/match}}</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/cecilia_irene/96/704_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>Cecilia_Irene</strong></figcaption></figure>
