            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>{{#match @site.locale "en"}}“…The community is essential so we aren't isolated and can support one another.”{{else}}“…La comunidad es fundamental para no estar aislado y apoyarnos unos a otros.”{{/match}}</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/bilbonauta/96/3415_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>bilbonauta</strong></figcaption></figure>
