            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>{{#match @site.locale "en"}}“In this group you can see the drive to improve and help one another…”{{else}}“En este grupo se ven las ganas de mejorar y ayudarse entre todos…”{{/match}}</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/santi.esteve/96/548_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>Santi.Esteve</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>{{#match @site.locale "en"}}“This course is a shortcut that saves you hundreds of hours of searching for and interpreting information…”{{else}}“Este curso es un atajo que te permite ahorrarte cientos de horas de búsqueda e interpretación de información…”{{/match}}</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/natanael107/96/1214_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>Natanael107</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>{{#match @site.locale "en"}}“…I can say there was a bonus I didn't expect, and that was having a mentor.”{{else}}“…Puedo decir que existió un plus que no me esperaba, y era la presencia de un mentor.”{{/match}}</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/francop/96/1737_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>FrancoP</strong></figcaption></figure>
